     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRMediaLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRMediaLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRMediaLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-observation-media</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-image-illustrative</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMObservationMedia</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAImageIllustrative</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMObservationMedia.identifiant</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAImageIllustrative.id</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMObservationMedia.content.data</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAImageIllustrative.value</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMObservationMedia.content.contentType</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAImageIllustrative.value.mediaType</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMObservationMedia.subject:FRLMPatient</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAImageIllustrative.subject</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMObservationMedia.subject:FRLMSpecimen</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAImageIllustrative.specimen</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMObservationMedia.note</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Le profil CDA ne comporte pas d'élément dédié pour représenter une note.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMObservationMedia.header.performer[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAImageIllustrative.performer</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMObservationMedia.header.participant[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAImageIllustrative.participant</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMObservationMedia.header.author[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAImageIllustrative.author</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMObservationMedia.header.informant[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAImageIllustrative.informant</td><td/></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-observation-media</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-media-document</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMObservationMedia</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRMediaDocument</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMObservationMedia.identifiant</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" tit